mpany paid $2 billion to repurchase its own shares and $205 million in dividends: $2.2 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["MRVL.buybacks.2026","MRVL.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-08-01 revenue was $2.7 billion, up 36.5% from $2 billion in the three months ended 2025-08-02.","cites":["MRVL.d.revenue.2026-05-03.2026-08-01","MRVL.d.revenue.2025-05-04.2025-08-02"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-08-01 revenue added up to $9.5 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $1.6 billion and net income to $2.6 billion.","cites":["MRVL.d.revenue.2025-08-03.2025-11-01","MRVL.d.revenue.2025-02-02.2026-01-31","MRVL.d.revenue.2025-02-02.2025-11-01","MRVL.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-05-02","MRVL.d.revenue.2026-05-03.2026-08-01","MRVL.d.opinc.2025-08-03.2025-11-01","MRVL.d.opinc.2025-02-02.2026-01-31","MRVL.d.opinc.2025-02-02.2025-11-01","MRVL.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-05-02","MRVL.d.opinc.2026-05-03.2026-08-01","MRVL.d.netinc.2025-08-03.2025-11-01","MRVL.d.netinc.2025-02-02.2026-01-31","MRVL.d.netinc.2025-02-02.2025-11-01","MRVL.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-05-02","MRVL.d.netinc.2026-05-03.2026-08-01"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.7 billion: operating cash flow of $2.2 billion less capital spending of $470 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["MRVL.d.ocf.2025-02-02.2025-11-01","MRVL.d.ocf.2025-02-02.2025-08-02","MRVL.d.ocf.2025-02-02.2026-01-31","MRVL.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-05-02","MRVL.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-08-01","MRVL.d.capex.2025-02-02.2025-11-01","MRVL.d.capex.2025-02-02.2025-08-02","MRVL.d.capex.2025-02-02.2026-01-31","MRVL.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-05-02","MRVL.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-08-01"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-05-13 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2026 as $25.1 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as -$69.7 million.","cites":["MRVL.pay.peoTotal.2026","MRVL.pay.peoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $24.9 million in total and $9.3 million actually paid.","cites":["MRVL.pay.neoTotal.2026","MRVL.pay.neoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $156.47 at the end of FY2026, and $293.24 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["MRVL.pay.tsr.2026","MRVL.pay.peerTsr.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $40.1 million at the end of FY2026 (tagged DeferredRevenueCurrent), against $22.1 million a year earlier.","cites":["MRVL.deferred.2026","MRVL.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 7,480 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $1.1 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["MRVL.q.employees","MRVL.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $30 million, after $185 million in FY2025.","cites":["MRVL.restructuring.2026","MRVL.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $2.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $4.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + ShortTermBorrowings). Debt less cash was $1.8 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["MRVL.cash.2026","MRVL.debtLong.2026","MRVL.debtShort.2026"]}]},"fin":{"MRVL":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":74,"read":74,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["MURPHY MATTHEW J","Chairman of the Board and CEO, director"],["Koopmans Chris","President and COO"],["Bharathi Sandeep","President, Data Center Group"],["Scarpulla Justin","SVP, Chief Accounting Officer"],["Durn Daniel","Chief Financial Officer"],["Meintj